OL,3,GNEWSAPlans lodged to convert former
OL,4,Acity pub into flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been lodged to turn a former
OL,7,Fpub in Derby into flats.
OL,9,FKandore Properties has submitted a
OL,10,Fplanning application to Derby City
OL,11,FCouncil to convert the Vulcan Arms in
OL,12,FSt Thomas Road into seven flats.
OL,14,FAccording to planning documents the pub
OL,15,Fclosed its doors earlier this year and
OL,16,Fwas in "fair condition" but would need
OL,17,F"substantial investment" to resume
OL,18,Foperation.
OL,20,FPlans state the proposed conversion
OL,21,Fwould utilise an "underused" site in a
OL,22,F"sustainable location".
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
